<title>BELGIUM: Commission to review Portuguese sugar certificates.</title>
<headline>Commission to review Portuguese sugar certificates.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will examine a complaint by Portugal that it cannot get certificates of origin for imports of Brazilian raw cane sugar imports to Portuguese ports in time, an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The European Union's sugar management committee heard from the Portuguese on Wednesday that it was impossible to get the certificates of origin from  Brazil to destination ports in time,&quot; the official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Current regulations require certificates of origin to be at the port of arrival when shipments arrive.</p>
<p>The European Commission said that it will review the situation, the official added.</p>
</text>
